# cross-lib-activity — Lib B (the SHARED disposition library).
library "Shared".

// A plain CommunicationRequest activity that a decision in ANOTHER library
// (Root) recommends via a cross-library qualified ref `"Shared"."Shared Deny"`.
// Lib B is ACTIVITIES-ONLY (no `code is`, no decision). Post-#186, consumed by the
// single decision library Root, its empty CQL + hollow Library are SUPPRESSED: no
// `Shared` CQL/Library is emitted, and its ActivityDefinition + Recommendation
// PlanDefinition rebind their `library[]` onto Root's Interface library.
activity "Shared Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied.`.
